{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05802","headline":"奉和喜雪应制 · 徐安贞","name":"奉和喜雪应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"两宫斋祭近登临，雨雪纷纷天昼阴。\n祗爲经寒无瑞色，顿教正月满春林。\n蓬莱北上旌门暗，花萼南归马迹深。\n自有三农歌帝力，还将万庾荅尧心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐安贞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05802.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05802","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}